DESCRIPTION:Get out the flannels and dust off your Docs! Midlife Riot is a San Rafael\, California based 4-piece bringing you all the anthems of 90s alternative rock. Featuring seasoned musicians from the Bay Area scene\, the band delivers a high-energy show packed with the hits that defined a generation. We play Green Day\, Blink 182\, Oasis\, Weezer\, Foo Fighters\, Gin Blossoms\, Nirvana\, and anything else from 120 Minutes.
